SUMMARY:5th Annual Danforth Bible Conference
DESCRIPTION:The Christians gathered to the name of the Lord Jesus Christ at Danforth Gospel Hall will hold our 5th annual conference October 30th – November 1st focusing on the theme of “Knowing Him”. Our main speakers this year are Sean O’Byrne and Gary Weeks. \nPreaching the Lord Jesus Christ in East Toronto since 1899
