SUMMARY:Mark Battenberg Music presents The Hallowe’en Concert
DESCRIPTION:Mark Battenberg Music presents The Hallowe’en Concert\, for all of you adults who want to be kids on Hallowe’en. Please join guitarist and poet Mark Battenberg and Shakuhachi Flute master Debbie Danbrook for a fun evening of Haunting Music and Scary Poetry. Dress up as spooky as you want and you might win a prize. All welcome. Admission is $20 or pay what you can.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/mark-battenberg-music-presents-the-halloween-concert/
LOCATION:Danforth Mennonite Church\, 2174 Danforth Ave.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
