SUMMARY:Art Guild of Scarborough's Fall Art Show and Sale
DESCRIPTION:The Art Guild of Scarborough’s Fall Juried Art Show and Sale features over 400 original\, juried works of art by member artists\, many of whom will be in attendance. Works include watercolour\, pastel\, oil\, acrylic\, ink\, sculpture and mixed media. Free parking\, admission and refreshments!\nThe Art Guild of Scarborough is a non-profit organization. Since 1962\, it has brought together artists to promote and celebrate the creation of original art. Members range in experience from novice to professional. The Art Guild of Scarborough holds weekly member meetings featuring both demonstrations by notable artists and hands-on art activities.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/art-guild-of-scarboroughs-fall-art-show-and-sale-2/
LOCATION:Centennial Recreation Centre\, 1967 Ellesmere Rd.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/19192651/2026-TAGS-Fall-Show-Flyer-Colour.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Art Guild of Scarborough":MAILTO:info@theartguildofscarborough.com
END:VEVENT
